		<h2><span class="fontsize-1-5em"><span class="futura-bold">Latest Emergency Care news</span></span></h2>
<p><span class="fontsize-1-25em">The Emergency Care Newsroom is your source for product and business updates, industry news, clinical information, inspiring stories and more.</span></p>
<p><span class="fontsize-1-25em"><a href="/us/en/emergency-care/news.html"><span class="standalone-link">Read more</span></a></span></p>

