    <div class="latestnews"><div class="c-latestnews container page-section">
  
  
  <div class="c-latestnews-content">
    
    <div class="border-bottom-gold">
      <div class="row latestnews-container">
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-3 item">
          <img class="img-responsive" src="https://media-assets.stryker.com/is/image/stryker/pts-vernon_web-banner?$preset_307_184$" alt="Firefighter from Vernon Township looking into the sky at a rescue helicopter making a descent" data-trackable="true" data-aem-asset-id="9b4ffd6f-7870-40c6-882c-10f5408ef7ff"/>
          <div class="m-c-subheading-description">
            <h3>Vernon Township FD: Empowering first responders for every call</h3>
          </div>
            <p class="model"></p>
            <p class="description">When Chief Culberson transitioned to Vernon Township Fire Department, her first priority was to equip her team with the right tools to support their growing call volume and diverse range of emergencies.</p>
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/news/2025/vernon-township-fd-empowering-first-responders-for-every-call.html" class="news-link action-link">Read More</a>
        </div>
      
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-3 item">
          <img class="img-responsive" src="https://media-assets.stryker.com/is/image/stryker/eGuide%20Newsroom%201440x816?$preset_307_184$" alt="LIFEPAK 35 on a Power-PRO 2 at the scene of a car crash" data-trackable="true" data-aem-asset-id="d9f4d03a-2449-4892-b38d-6b47def9c89f"/>
          <div class="m-c-subheading-description">
            <h3>Why a powered fleet is key for EMS and fire departments</h3>
          </div>
            <p class="model">5 benefits of powered equipment you don’t want to ignore</p>
            <p class="description">There’s nothing predictable about the world of fire and rescue but having the right equipment in place can make all the difference. </p>
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/news/2025/why-powered-fleet-is-key-ems-fire-departments.html" class="news-link action-link">Read More</a>
        </div>
      
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-3 item">
          <img class="img-responsive" src="https://media-assets.stryker.com/is/image/stryker/Delhi%20Newsroom%201440x816?$preset_307_184$" alt="Delhi Township Fire responds to call on the river" data-trackable="true" data-aem-asset-id="8259c291-e9a9-4d06-bc83-b4321e865e65"/>
          <div class="m-c-subheading-description">
            <h3>Delhi Township Fire stays ready for any call, in any terrain, at any time</h3>
          </div>
            <p class="model"></p>
            <p class="description">Delhi Township Fire doesn’t specialize in one thing—they respond to everything. That means they face not only a wide range of emergencies, but also a variety of physical environments and logistical challenges.</p>
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/news/2025/delhi-township-fire-department-stays-ready-for-any-call.html" class="news-link action-link">Read More</a>
        </div>
      
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-3 item">
          <img class="img-responsive" src="https://media-assets.stryker.com/is/image/stryker/ec-newsroom_pediatric-technology_thumbnail_1440x816?$preset_307_184$" alt="Students walking in school hallway" data-trackable="true" data-aem-asset-id="3ad81863-12b0-4063-a410-5f297e45bc42"/>
          <div class="m-c-subheading-description">
            <h3>Enhancing pediatric advanced life support: A tool for lifesaving care</h3>
          </div>
            <p class="model">The LIFEPAK 35 is designed to support clinical teams when every second counts</p>
            <p class="description">The LIFEPAK 35 monitor/defibrillator was designed to support pediatric resuscitation and advanced care, helping clinicians respond with precision in critical moments.</p>
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/news/2025/enhancing-pediatric-advanced-life-support.html" class="news-link action-link">Read More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  
</div>
</div>


    
    
