          <div class="desc-container">
            <h3>LIFEPAK 35 monitor/defibrillator</h3>
            <p>The LIFEPAK 35 monitor/defibrillator for hospitals and EMS is a future-ready device designed to promote confident cardiac care, enable clinical excellence and deliver in demanding environments.</p>
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/products/lifepak-35.html" class="action-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-3 item">
