            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/products/xpedition-powered-stair-chair.html">
              <img class="img-responsive" src="https://media-assets.stryker.com/is/image/stryker/Thumbnail_Xpedition_307x184_Transparent?$preset_426_254$" alt="Xpedition powered patient transport chair " title="Xpedition powered patient transport chair " data-trackable="true" data-aem-asset-id="5e7c3edc-ae3c-4272-80cc-68921f4539d8"/>
            </a>
            
          </div>
          <div class="desc-container">
            <h3>Xpedition powered stair chair</h3>
            <p>Xpedition, Stryker’s first powered stair chair, helps get the job done easier and more effectively with increased comfort and security for both your team and the patient—because the journey is just as important as the destination.</p>
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/products/xpedition-powered-stair-chair.html" class="action-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      
