            </a>
            
          </div>
          <div class="desc-container">
            <h3>LUCAS 3, v3.1 chest compression system</h3>
            <p>Deliver high-performance, continuous chest compressions.</p>
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/products/lucas-3.html" class="action-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    
