            </a>
            
          </div>
          <div class="desc-container">
            <h3>HeartSine samaritan PAD 450P</h3>
            
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/products/heartsine-samaritan-pad-450p.html" class="action-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-3 item">
          <div class="img-cont">
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/products/lifenet-care.html">
              <img class="img-responsive" src="https://media-assets.stryker.com/is/image/stryker/lifenet-care-thumbnail-2?$preset_426_254$" alt="LIFENET Care screen on a computer " title="LIFENET Care screen on a computer " data-trackable="true" data-aem-asset-id="47042fcd-1506-4ed1-bca2-018e8501c240"/>
            </a>
            
          </div>
          <div class="desc-container">
            <h3>LIFENET Care</h3>
            <p>Get a more unified view of your patient's journey by customizing protocols on a modern, clean interface. LIFENET Care makes it easy to consolidate patient data, organize your workflow and connect care teams to make your job easier.</p>
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/products/lifenet-care.html" class="action-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      
