            </a>
            
          </div>
          <div class="desc-container">
            <h3>Power-LOAD</h3>
            <p>Our Power-LOAD cot fastener improves operator and patient safety by supporting the cot throughout the loading and unloading process.</p>
            <a href="/us/en/emergency-care/products/power-load.html" class="action-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-3 item">
